    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI assistant helping a company automate financial operations. Your task is to write a professional, clear, and polite payment reminder email addressed to the company's CEO. The email should notify them about an upcoming or due invoice so they can review and take necessary action.\n\nHere is the parsed invoice data that you must use to fill in the email details:\n- Sender Name: {{ $json.fields['Sender Name'] }}\n- Sender Address: {{ $json.fields['Sender Address'] }}\n- Sender Email: {{ $json.fields['Sender Email'] }}\n- Invoice Date: {{ $json.fields['Invioce date '] }}\n- Due Date: {{ $json.fields['Due Date'] }}\n- Total Amount: {{ $json.fields['Total Amount '] }}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Write a ready-to-send professional email body. Do not use generic placeholders like [Your Name] or [Company Name] where actual data is available; use the provided data.\n2. Keep the tone formal, executive, and concise.\n3. Clearly highlight the Total Amount, Invoice Date, and specifically the Due Date so the CEO knows the urgency.\n4. Include a clear subject line at the beginning of the output (e.g., Subject: Payment Reminder...).\n5. Output ONLY the final email text ready to be sent. Do not add any extra conversational filler, explanations, or code blocks around the email.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
